/div></div></div><div id="professional-image" data-bid="professional-image" class="sb sib-professional-image"><div class="ss-s ss-bg"><div class="sb-m"></div><div class="sc" style="width:1200px"></div></div></div><div id="brand-bio" data-bid="brand-bio" class="sb sib-brand-bio"><div class="ss-s ss-bg"><div class="sc" style="width:1200px"><div data-sid="brand-bio_0" class="sie-brand-bio_0 se-bd se"><div class="se-simple"></div></div><div class="str-im str-id" data-tran="brand-bio_1"><div data-sid="brand-bio_1" class="sie-brand-bio_1 se"><p class="se-t sie-brand-bio_1-text st-m-title st-d-title se-rc">We are a world-renowned spiritual coaching institute that offers high-quality, experiential and in-depth programs that you can trust.</p></div></div><div class="str-im str-id" data-tran="brand-bio_2"><div data-sid="brand-bio_2" class="sie-brand-bio_2 se"><h2 class="se-t sie-brand-bio_2-text st-m-heading st-d-heading se-rc">who we are<br></h2></div></div><div data-sid="brand-bio_3" class="sie-brand-bio_3 se"><iframe title="891321599" src="//player.vimeo.com/video/891321599?api=1&amp;autoplay=1&amp;autopause=0&amp;muted=1" style="border:none" width="100%" height="100%" frameBorder="0" allow="autoplay https://player.vimeo.com; fullscreen https://player.vimeo.com;" data-player="vimeo"></iframe></div></div></div></div><div id="meet-coaches" data-bid="meet-coaches" class="sb sib-meet-coaches"><div class="ss-s ss-bg"><div class="sc" style="width:1200px"><div class="str-im str-id" data-tran="meet-coaches_0"><div data-sid="meet-coaches_0" class="sie-meet-coaches_0 se"><div style="width:100%;height:100%" data-img="meet-coaches_0" class="se-img se-gr slzy"><span role="img" aria-label="Abstract Art - Highest Self Institute"></span></div><noscript><img src="//static.showit.co/800/P01_-2mlRiuEDH6Mfzu1mw/170803/highest_self_pattern_8-_faded.png" class="se-img" alt="Abstract Art - Highest Self Institute" title="Highest Self Pattern 8- Faded"/></noscript></div></div><div data-sid="meet-coaches_1" class="sie-meet-coaches_1 se"><div class="se-simple"></div></div><div data-sid="meet-coaches_2" class="sie-meet-coaches_2 se-bd se"><div class="se-simple"></div></div><div data-sid="meet-coaches_3" class="sie-meet-coaches_3 se"><div style="width:100%;height:100%" data-img="meet-coaches_3" class="se-img se-gr slzy"><span role="img" aria-label="Sahara &amp; Neeta of Highest Self Institute"></span></div><noscript><img src="//static.showit.co/800/hB4gdpP9QG-87o4fW_W3Hw/170803/sahara-2.png" class="se-img" alt="Sahara &amp; Neeta of Highest Self Institute" title="sahara-2"/></noscript></div><div class="str-id" data-tran="meet-coaches_4"><div data-sid="meet-coaches_4" class="sie-meet-coaches_4 se"><div class="se-simple"></div></div></div><a href="/about" target="_self" class="sie-meet-coaches_5 se" data-sid="meet-coaches_5"><p class="se-t sie-meet-coaches_5-text st-m-heading st-d-heading">learn more</p></a><div class="str-id" data-tran="meet-coaches_6"><div data-sid="meet-coaches_6" class="sie-meet-coaches_6 se"><p class="se-t sie-meet-coaches_6-text st-m-paragraph st-d-paragraph se-rc">Host of the Highest Self Podcast + Founder of Highest Self Institute
<br><br>If my podcast has sparked something in you—an awakening, a remembrance, a knowing that you’re meant for more—then you’re in the right place. At Highest Self Institute, we take the spiritual insights you’ve been exploring and teach you how to turn them into a soul-aligned career.
<br><br>Whether you’re ready to become a certified coach, start your own healing business, or bring more purpose into your life, this is where the next step of your journey begins.<br></p></div></div><div class="str-id" data-tran="meet-coaches_7"><div data-sid="meet-coaches_7" class="sie-meet-coaches_7 se"><h3 class="se-t sie-meet-coaches_7-text st-m-title st-d-title se-rc">Hi, I'm Sahara Rose</h3></div></div><div class="str-id" data-tran="meet-coaches_8"><div data-sid="meet-coaches_8" class="sie-meet-coaches_8 se"><h2 class="se-t sie-meet-coaches_8-text st-m-heading st-d-heading se-rc">meet the founder</h2></div></div></div></div></div><div id="certifications" data-bid="certifications" class="sb sib-certifications"><div class="ss-s ss-bg"><div class="sc" style="width:1200px"><div data-sid="certifications_0" class="sie-certifications_0 se"><div class="se-simple"></div></div><div class="str-id" data-tran="certifications_1"><a href="/certifications-and-courses#certified-spiritual-life-coach-header" target="_self" class="sie-certifications_1 se-bd se-bm se" data-sid="certifications_1"><div class="se-simple"></div></a></div><div data-sid="certifications_2" class="sie-certifications_2 se"><div style="width:100%;height:100%" data-img="certifications_2" class="se-img se-gr slzy"><span role="img" aria-label="Animated Butterfly"></span></div><noscript><img src="//static.showit.co/file/lpC5pSm5S_m7M9sDW1hGQw/170803/animated_butterfly.gif" class="se-img" alt="Animated Butterfly" title="Animated Butterfly"/></noscript></div><div class="str-id" data-tran="certifications_4"><a href="/certifications-and-courses#embodiment-coach-header" target="_self" class="sie-certifications_4 se-bd se-bm se" data-sid="certifications_4"><div class="se-simple"></div></a></div><a href="/courses" target="_self" class="sie-certifications_5 se" data-sid="certifications_5"><div class="se-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512"><path d="M256,41C137.26,41,41,137.26,41,256s96.2