><p class="se-t sie-about-our-students_3-text st-m-paragraph st-d-paragraph se-rc">Our community consists of unique, multifaceted, and soulful individuals from all races, gender orientations, ages, abilities, and backgrounds.</p></div></div><div class="str-im str-id" data-tran="about-our-students_4"><div data-sid="about-our-students_4" class="sie-about-our-students_4 se"><div style="width:100%;height:100%" data-img="about-our-students_4" class="se-img se-gr slzy"><span role="img" aria-label="Highest Self Institute - Multi-Faceted"></span></div></div></div><div class="str-im str-id" data-tran="about-our-students_5"><div data-sid="about-our-students_5" class="sie-about-our-students_5 se"><p class="se-t sie-about-our-students_5-text st-m-paragraph st-d-paragraph se-rc">We are extremely diverse. Over 50% of us are people of color, including our founders.&nbsp;</p></div></div><div class="str-im str-id" data-tran="about-our-students_6"><div data-sid="about-our-students_6" class="sie-about-our-students_6 se"><div style="width:100%;height:100%" data-img="about-our-students_6" class="se-img se-gr slzy"><span role="img" aria-label="Highest Self Institute - Diverse"></span></div></div></div><div class="str-im str-id" data-tran="about-our-students_7"><div data-sid="about-our-students_7" class="sie-about-our-students_7 se"><p class="se-t sie-about-our-students_7-text st-m-paragraph st-d-paragraph se-rc">We are heart-centered, full of life and have transmuted our obstacles into our greatest offerings. We take our purpose seriously, without taking ourselves too seriously.&nbsp;</p></div></div><div class="str-im str-id" data-tran="about-our-students_8"><div data-sid="about-our-students_8" class="sie-about-our-students_8 se"><div style="width:100%;height:100%" data-img="about-our-students_8" class="se-img se-gr slzy"><span role="img" aria-label="Highest Self Institute - Heart Centered"></span></div></div></div><div class="str-im str-id" data-tran="about-our-students_9"><div data-sid="about-our-students_9" class="sie-about-our-students_9 se"><p class="se-t sie-about-our-students_9-text st-m-paragraph st-d-paragraph se-rc">Our students are equal parts soul and strategy. They strive to expand into their highest selves and make a career out of helping others - one that leaves them in love with their lives and bursting with joy every day.</p></div></div><div class="str-im str-id" data-tran="about-our-students_10"><div data-sid="about-our-students_10" class="sie-about-our-students_10 se"><div style="width:100%;height:100%" data-img="about-our-students_10" class="se-img se-gr slzy"><span role="img" aria-label="Highest Self Institute - Soul &amp; Strategy"></span></div></div></div><div class="str-im str-id" data-tran="about-our-students_11"><div data-sid="about-our-students_11" class="sie-about-our-students_11 se"><h2 class="se-t sie-about-our-students_11-text st-m-title st-d-title se-rc">About our Students<br></h2></div></div><div class="str-im str-id" data-tran="about-our-students_12"><div data-sid="about-our-students_12" class="sie-about-our-students_12 se"><h3 class="se-t sie-about-our-students_12-text st-m-heading st-d-heading se-rc">at the heart of it all</h3></div></div></div></div></div><div id="students-image" data-bid="students-image" class="sb sib-students-image"><div class="ss-s ss-bg"><div class="sb-m ssp-d"></div><div class="sc" style="width:1200px"></div></div></div><div id="press" data-bid="press" class="sb sib-press"><div class="ss-s ss-bg"><div class="sc" style="width:1200px"><div class="str-id" data-tran="press_0"><div data-sid="press_0" class="sie-press_0 se"><div style="width:100%;height:100%" data-img="press_0" class="se-img se-gr slzy"><span role="img" aria-label="Highest Self Institute - Featured on CBS Austin"></span></div></div></div><div class="str-id" data-tran="press_1"><div data-sid="press_1" class="sie-press_1 se"><div style="width:100%;height:100%" data-img="press_1" class="se-img se-gr slzy"><span role="img" aria-label="Highest Self Institute - Featured on NBC"></span></div></div></div><div class="str-id" data-tran="press_2"><div data-sid="press_2" class="sie-press_2 se"><div style="width:100%;height:100%" data-img="press_2" class="se-img se-gr slzy"><span role="img" aria-label="Highest Self Institute - Featured in Forbes"></span></div></div></div><div data-sid="press_3" class="sie-press_3 se"><h2 class="se-t sie-press_3-text st-m-heading st-d-heading se-rc">featured on</h2></div></div></div></div><div id="cta" data-bid="cta" class="sb sib-cta"><div class="ss-s ss-bg"><div class="sc" style="width:1200px"><div class="str-im" data-tran="cta_0"><div data-sid="cta_0" class="sie-cta_0 se"><div style="width:100%;height:100%" data-img="cta_0" class="se-img se-gr slzy"><span role="img" aria-label="Neeta Bhushan - Coaches at Highest Self Institute - Get Certified for a Spiritual Coaching Career 1"></span></div><noscript><img src="//static.showit.co/800/TG37bdclSGCjEp-a0_5tGA/170803/sahara.png" class="se-img" alt="Neeta Bhushan - Coaches at Highest Self Institute - Get Certified for a Spiritual Coaching Career 1" title="sahara"/></noscript></div></div><div class="str-im" data-tran="cta_1"><div data-sid="cta_1" class="sie-cta_1 se"><div style="width:100%;height:100%" data-img="cta_1" class="se-img se-gr slzy"><span role="img" aria-label="Sahara Rose - Coaches at Highest Self Institute - Get Certified for a Spiritual Coaching Career 3"></span></div><noscript><img src="//static.showit.co/800/UegWh-kEKngo6TYs-Y3SfQ/170803/sahara-rose-celiadluna-0008_1.jpg" class="se-img" alt="Sahara Rose - Coaches at Highest Self Institute - Get Certified for a Spiritual Coaching Career 3" title="Sahara-Rose-CeliaDLuna-0008 (1)"/></noscript></div></div><div data-sid="cta_2" class="sie-cta_2 se"><div class="se-simple"></div></div><div class="str-id" data-tran="cta_3"><a href="https://sahararosecourses.com/" target="_self" class="sie-cta_3 se" data-sid="cta_3"><div class="se-simple"></div></a></div><a href="https://sahararosecourses.com/" target="_self" class="sie-cta_4 se" data-sid="cta_4"><p class="se-t sie-cta_4-text st-m-heading st-d-heading">I’m Ready To Speak With Soul</p></a><div class="str-im str-id" data-tran="cta_5"><div data-sid="cta_5" class="sie-cta_5 se"><p class="se-t sie-cta_5-text st-m-paragraph st-d-paragraph se-rc">Go from awkward to confident speaker in just 21 days through Sahara’s Speak With Soul Method<br><br>You are meant to share your story. Now it’s time to prepare for it! This transformative method will help you speak on camera for social media, on stages for your future keynote speech, be interviewed for podcasts and even record your own podcast intro on the 21st day!<br><br></p></div></div><div data-sid="cta_6" class="sie-cta_6 se"><h2 class="se-t sie-cta_6-text st-m-title st-d-title se-rc">Share Your Voice<br></h2></div></div></div></div><div id="footer" data-bid="footer" class="sb sib-footer"><div class="ss-s ss-bg"><div class="sc" style="width:1200px"><a href="#si-sp" target="_self" class="sie-footer_0 se se-sl" data-sid="footer_0"><div class="se-t sie-footer_0-text st-m-subheading st-d-subheading">→</div></a><div data-sid="footer_1" class="sie-footer_1 se"><p class="se-t sie-footer_1-text st-m-heading st-d-heading se-rc">© Highest self institute&nbsp; 2025&nbsp; | <a href="/terms-of-use" target="_self">Terms of Use</a> | <a href="/privacy-policy" target="_self">Privacy Policy</a> |&nbsp; Design &amp;&nbsp;Customized by <a href="https://gowithepic.com/" target="_blank">epic</a><br></p></div><a href="https://www.instagram.com/highestselfinstitute" target="_blank" class="sie-footer_2 se" data-sid="footer_2"><p class="se-t sie-footer_2-text st-m-heading st-d-heading">@highestselfinstitute</p></a><div data-sid="footer_3" class="sie-footer_3 se"><div id="footer_3" class="si-social-grid" data-account="82bacf74-43d2-4498-9095-fa99289f7d88" data-allow-video="1" data-allow-carousel="1" data-allow-image="1" data-allow-caption="1" data-has-fallback=